Statement of changes (Apache-2.0 section 4b)
--------------------------------------------

Relative to mmdetection3d v1.0.0rc3, this repository:

  - adds the incremental training pipeline (tools/train_incremental_scene.py,
    tools/incremental_scene/, tools/eval_incremental.py);
  - adds learning-dynamics scoring, the scene memory bank and the intra-stage
    review sampler (mmdet3d/utils/learning_dynamics_scoring.py,
    mmdet3d/datasets/scene_memory_bank.py, mmdet3d/utils/ld_strategy_config.py);
  - adds incremental dataset wrappers and pseudo-label generation
    (mmdet3d/datasets/incremental_*.py, mmdet3d/datasets/pseudo_label_*.py);
  - adds 40-class ScanNet and SUN RGB-D data converters
    (tools/data_converter/*_40class.py, scannet_correct_class_ids.py);
  - modifies mmdet3d/models/dense_heads/tr3d_head.py for dynamic head expansion;
  - removes components of mmdetection3d not used by this work.


